│                          │ sampling around the remembered best. With retained velocities and reevaluated personal    │
│                          │ memories, this could reduce disruptive repositioning while maintaining local exploration. │
│                          │ Detection and memory costs remain unchanged. This tests a simpler competing allocation    │
│                          │ hypothesis without introducing unsupported state thresholds; improvement requires         │
│                          │ measurement at the same evaluation budget.                                                │
